# Savestate round-trip corpus for Spyro 3, read by
# tests/harness/check_state_roundtrip.sh. Fields and values: see
# games/spyro-1/corpus/state-roundtrip.manifest.
- | none | - | 1500 |
# The check_card_boot.sh fixture boot, saved and loaded at VBL 600: the
# directory load's read of sector 9 is in flight between the vblank step
# that started it and its completion. The state, which holds the card, is
# loaded at 1000 by the saving run, by a fresh process holding the same
# card path, and by one holding another card path, which refuses it.
- | card-v6-blank.mcd | - | 600 | - | 1000
# The title overlay's own drive code (func_title_8007B87C polls the
# controller's interrupt flag at 0x1F801803) has controller interrupts
# queued at VBL 620; a state saved there and loaded 380 VBLs later, or by a
# fresh process, raises them at the VBLs they were due.
- | none | - | 620 | - | 1000
